herdr-tuicr

The tab bar in mods/tuicr-review/tabs.js is derived from Herdr app v0.1.15:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/blob/v0.1.15/defaults/mods/tabs/main.js
Herdr app is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications integrate an embedded tuicr review panel, availability detection,
workspace-scoped state, branch selection, terminal lifecycle and focus handling.
The rest of the integration was extracted from a personal Herdr customization.

tuicr is a separately installed program, not bundled or redistributed here.
Herdr, gpui-kit, and gpui-base are supplied by the host application.
This is an independent community mod, not an official Herdr or tuicr release.
